  "beer-hagolah:36:א": `Shabbos 100`,
  "beer-hagolah:36:ב": `And all amot of Eruvin are in an amah of six, except sometimes they are lenient and sometimes strict in a manner that it be for stringency):`,
  "beer-hagolah:4:_": `(Tosafos in the first chapter of Eruvin and Hagahot Maimoniyot chapter 17)`,
  "beer-hagolah:5:_": `Hagahot Ashiri in the first chapter, letter 5`,
