  "beer-hagolah:7:_": `Hagahot chapter 17`,
  "beer-hagolah:8:_": `Agreed from the Amoraim in Eruvin daf 80, and we do not say that crushing diminishes its measure, even though it must be in its height nineteen — this too is settled there, likewise in chapter 17`,
  "beer-hagolah:9:א": `The conclusion of the Gemara on daf 9`,
